'''Candied''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 4th tier in the Battle Pass during the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]].  It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This knife uses the default knife mesh. It has a red blade, on which there is a red and white candy cane pattern, hence the name. These two designs are separated by a white and gold streak. The guard is gold as well as the base beneath the handle. The handle is black. 

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Candied (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

